      "description" : "Ask before logging only when food, serving, day or an existing record is genuinely ambiguous. Unknown exact grams or milliliters alone do not block a clearly labelled estimate from text, photos or a clear matching committed portion. Choose portion for an ambiguous serving, food for food identity, day for the recording date, meal or workout for an ambiguous existing record. Use this tool alone, before any writes in this turn. Add candidates (at most 4 real meal_id, optional item_id) when the choice is among known records. Use kind confirm with exactly one meal candidate (meal_id only) before deleting a whole meal. The app displays its own question; the user answers in a new turn.",
